      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Stroika build thirdpartyproducts subdir stuff.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "\tBuild to CURRENT.BIUILDING – and only when that succeeds, rename it to CURRENT",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tThat way – if build is incomplete (or fails) – we try again, but if we succeed in rename, we know there is no more todo!!!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tEssentially as fast as what we have now but more robust in case of failures to buiold!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
